    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Now, what we can do is, we can copy the `shared_ptr`, which will create a new `shared_ptr` instance that points to the same control block and it's going to increase the `ref_count` to $2$."
      ],
      "id": "a74b584d"
    },
